{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kunobi-ninja/kache/pulls/1494","id":4812212525,"node_id":"PR_kwDORRBv5c8AAAABHtSJLQ","html_url":"https://github.com/kunobi-ninja/kache/pull/1494","diff_url":"https://github.com/kunobi-ninja/kache/pull/1494.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/kunobi-ninja/kache/pull/1494.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kunobi-ninja/kache/issues/1494","number":1494,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"chore: bump kache to v1.1.0","user":{"login":"jleni","id":13698520,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjk4NTIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13698520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jleni","html_url":"https://github.com/jleni","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jleni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jleni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jleni/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jleni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jleni/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jleni/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jleni/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jleni/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jleni/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Bumps the workspace, the publishable crates and the service chart to 1.1.0.\n\nRelease remains blocked on performance. Keep this PR as a draft until paired benchmarks on the final source head clear the regressions against v1.0.\n\nSix paired Kobe runs on performance-fix head `a4610038` (#1497), with phase tracing disabled, found Biome unchanged builds +25.05% (95% interval +21.01% to +26.02%) slower and documentation-edit builds +22.09% (95% interval +17.77% to +25.45%) slower. Every run restored 674 units with zero misses and three passthroughs.\n\nThe same head no longer reproduces the previous +14.1% Aube first-edit regression against v1.0. Six paired runs measured first edits at +0.65% (95% interval -0.73% to +2.75%) and initial builds at -7.65% (95% interval -8.49% to -6.93%).\n\n#1495, #1496 and #1497 have merged. PR-head CI for #1497 passed, including all four changed-line mutation shards and executed platform checks; Nix was skipped. Merged main `4ee0f9e2` has the same source tree measured on Kobe. The first-edit result does not clear the remaining warm-build regressions. No release has been published.\n\n## Release plan\n\n- Repair and measure warm performance, then merge the validated fixes with green CI.\n- Rebase this PR onto main and repeat the performance gate on the final release source.\n- Squash this PR after performance validation passes.\n- Warm the Windows sysroot cache from main, then run `just release` from synced main.\n- Watch CI, Service Image, Publish crates and Package Publish, then rewrite the release notes.\n","created_at":"2026-10-10T15:11:56Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T23:34:22Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"2bb2bfe7f10f8634f3c9d8802eb6ab8eaf9b717e","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"emmanuelm41","id":10941036,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwOTQxMDM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10941036?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelm41","html_url":"https://github.com/emmanuelm41","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelm41/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelm41/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelm41/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelm41/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelm41/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelm41/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelm41/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelm41/events{/privacy}","received_even